Reason: Only 0result.sql builds the regression on a complete daily time‑series that includes zero‑sale days (via the recursive dates CTE).  Because the model is trained on every calendar day between 2017‑01‑01 and 2018‑08‑29—as the task explicitly requires—it correctly represents “daily sales data”.  The other two scripts (1result.sql and 2result.sql) train the regression using only the days on which at least one toy was sold, omitting all zero‑sale days and therefore violating the specification.